# Paths `tauri dev` must not rebuild the application for.
#
# The desktop crate depends on `azdocs` by path, so the watcher covers both
# desktop/src-tauri and the workspace root — which meant editing a Markdown
# file recompiled the app. Nothing listed here can change what the binary does.
#
# Patterns are gitignore-style and deliberately unanchored, so they match under
# either watch root.

# Prose and generated documentation
*.md
*.html
docs/

# Golden files. The app never reads them, and `cargo insta` rewrites them in bulk.
snapshots/

# The frontend: Vite serves and hot-reloads it itself, so a change here must not
# also trigger a Rust rebuild.
desktop/src/
desktop/dist/
desktop/node_modules/

# Tool output, all regenerable
output/
graphify-out/
.impeccable/

# Editor droppings
.DS_Store
*.swp
